WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Sequence the reusable
assets before wider agency.

00:00:03.307 --> 00:00:07.040
First, establish task
identity, approved tools,

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:09.600
baseline measurement
and an evidence contract.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.680
Next, make runners and failure
cases usable across teams.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:19.120
Then consider scoped tool adapters and
recovery exercises for delegated actions.

00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:23.440
Each horizon retains domain
ownership and an explicit trade-off.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:26.640
Shared services need funded operators,

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.280
and broader authority needs owners who
accept the consequences and recovery duty.
